  "notes": "Simulation concept only. 150 kg assumed total mass; 3.5 m projected span; lifting centerbody plus joined shoulder and outer anhedral panels. Twelve 360 N nominal EDFs. Rear longitudinal forward tilts 40/80/40/80 degrees per side, front 60 degrees; all 5 degrees outward lateral direction. Hover and ground attitude 60 degrees nose up. Long legs are temporary simulation supports. Stable forward flight observed around 67 km/h in Python and JSBSim. One JSBSim staged-deceleration run returned to hover, landed and disarmed. Abrupt braking failed. 100 km/h not achieved; robustness and real flight safety not demonstrated. NeuralFoil strip aerodynamics and assumed jetfoil turning loss require experimental validation. PX4 overrides are simulation tuning, not flight-qualified settings."
